{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33819","headline":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 药鱼 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 药鱼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾无竭泽心，何用药鱼药。\n见说放溪上，点点波光恶。\n食时竞夷犹，死者争纷泊。\n何必重伤鱼，毒泾犹可作。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33819.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33819","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}